abstract: >-
  GPU-accelerated Qiskit Aer examples: a Bell-state circuit, a VRAM-capped
  statevector capacity benchmark including a 28-qubit Colab run, executable
  Colab notebooks, a project website, and one-layer QAOA Max-Cut on a 27-node cycle.
